= Wang Jingwei Appointed as CEC Chairman

After a quick election due to Sun Yat-sen's death, Wang Jingwei came out on top as the Chairman of the Central Executive Committee. This has strengthened the Leftist faction significantly, as Wang Jingwei now takes the highest position in the Party.
